  "text_md": "## REALTOR® Price Expectations\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nREALTOR® Price Expectations for the Next 12 Months (U.S. Average in Blue Dashed Line)\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSource: NAR\n\n| REALTOR® Price Expectations   | Florida   | U.S.   |                                                                                  |\n|-------------------------------|-----------|--------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| 2022 - Mar                    | 3.9%      | 3.6%   | REALTORS® expect higher price growth  in Florida than in the U.S. in the next 12 |\n| Prior 12 months               | 1.4%      | 2.2%   | months. Their price expectations are also  higher than a year ago.               |",
